{"v":4,"catch":"使用您的雷達擊中球場檢查站並爭取高分！","desc":"《RALLY-X》是NAMCO於1980年發售的動作遊戲。\n玩家在收集旗幟的同時控制一輛汽車並躲避追趕的紅色汽車。\n當紅色汽車靠得太近時，使用煙幕擋住它們。\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2021-10-14","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.0GB / Switch 0.0GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/eb9b0bf5c5493524a3cce36d953302c3054218621fe82a51b150b52c4421c67a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/16b1b150b8fc2563677edc30bfb01dc2e7763afc66c934fc01dd4dd7e0083a07.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c82a2826245a2f516e4458c2dc9b2465b2d04156fa38155a9a3bc16e2e0c1bb3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/315c43909605237a47aa79a0c4fe4fdb9d9bf7de9fb082513f13f3b1c91ea98b.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8d0b6f6472020ce8ad04b7b624f03d398c724b41dc8d2ead7171307c03c1697e.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/053953d4add813511cf2561c3aaf9698dc603aa1cd424bb2a3fd65e6d3130e0b.jpg"],"titleId":"010026a015acc000","dlc":[]}